Fix build-ios end-to-end for unsigned IPA on macos-26/Xcode 26.6

This patch applies to commit 12b95f26548c973d5b58eb2d1cd8fca8084f3e42 (run #168).
global.json and Info.plist are already correct at that commit; this patch updates:

- .github/workflows/build-ios.yml: complete checkout-to-IPA workflow using the
  real Xcode 26.6 bundle, workload set 10.0.401, clean build outputs, unsigned
  publish, manual Payload/*.app IPA packaging, and artifact validation.
- AssetStudio.Mobile/MainPage.xaml.cs: add the missing OnTextureChannelsClicked
  handler and update ImageSharp 3.x APIs (ProcessPixelRows / SaveAsPng) so the
  iOS compile finishes.
